- Full suite passing: ~3700 tests.

## P2.3 marketplace bond eligibility

- `submit_marketplace_transaction` in `apps/blockchain-node/src/aitbc_chain/rpc/transactions.py`
  now checks for an active bond before accepting `offer`/`software_offer`
  GPU_MARKETPLACE transactions. The threshold is controlled by
  `MARKET_BOND_MIN_AMOUNT` (compute-seconds); a value of 0 disables the check.
- Bond check uses the active bond table and expires matured bonds.

## P2.1 ZK proofs for high-value jobs

- New `receipt_public` Circom circuit with `receiptHash` as a public input.
- Generated `receipt_public_0001.zkey`, `receipt_public.wasm`, and
  `verification_key.json` using a fresh power-of-tau 12 ceremony.
- `ZKProofService` now loads `receipt_public`, computes Poseidon4 inputs
  with `poseidon-lite`, and verifies proofs against the exported key.
- `apps/coordinator-api/.../miner.py`: result submission generates and
  attaches a verified ZK receipt proof when the job payment is above
  `COORDINATOR_ZK_HIGH_VALUE_THRESHOLD` (default 10 AIT) or the buyer sets
  `zk_proof_required` in `Constraints`.
- `apps/coordinator-api/.../payments.py`: `release_payment` blocks escrow
  release for high-value jobs when `zk_status` is not `verified`.
- `aitbc ai submit --zk-proof-required` lets buyers force the ZK gate.
- `JobView` exposes `zk_status` and `zk_proof_id`.
- `docs/scenarios/38_zk_high_value_jobs.md` added.
- Operational note: the `aitbc-coordinator-api` systemd unit needs
  `MemoryDenyWriteExecute=no` so the Node.js subprocesses used by snarkjs
  can allocate executable memory pages.

## v0.24.0-next — Live scenario playback fixes

### Fixed negative receipt `units`, `duration_ms` and `price`

- `apps/coordinator-api/src/coordinator_api/contexts/infrastructure/services/jobs.py`: store `requested_at`, `expires_at`, and `completed_at` as UTC.
- `apps/coordinator-api/src/coordinator_api/contexts/infrastructure/domain/job.py`: default `requested_at` and `expires_at` to UTC.
- `apps/coordinator-api/src/coordinator_api/contexts/infrastructure/routers/miner.py`: prefer `execution_time` from the miner result when computing `duration_ms`, and clamp negative values to 0.
- `apps/coordinator-api/src/coordinator_api/contexts/infrastructure/services/receipts.py`: clamp `units`, `unit_price`, and `price` to non-negative values; prefer `duration_ms` only when positive.
- `apps/miner/production_miner.py`: send `duration_ms` in metrics so the coordinator does not derive it from clock-sensitive timestamps.

### Fixed off-chain governance execution timelock

- `apps/governance/src/governance_service/services/governance_service.py`: when `enable_onchain_submission` is false, query the chain RPC for the current block height at proposal creation and record `voting_ends_block`. Also record the height at close time if it is still missing.
- `/etc/aitbc/aitbc-governance.env`: the temporary `GOVERNANCE_REQUIRE_EXECUTION_TIMELOCK=false` bypass has been removed.

### Operator documentation

- `docs/ops/aitbc-cli-live-setup.md`: new guide covering coordinator URL, JWT generation, client/shop commands, and governance live setup.
- `docs/scenarios/34_hub_customer_node_e2e.md`, `docs/scenarios/07_ai_job_submission.md`, `docs/scenarios/17_governance_voting.md`: cross-reference the live setup guide and use the correct `http://hub.aitbc.bubuit.net/c/v1` coordinator URL.

- fix(payments): `PaymentService.refund_payment` now calls the blockchain
  escrow `/rpc/escrow/{job_id}/refund` endpoint instead of the non-existent
  wallet `/api/v1/refund` endpoint.
- fix(jobs): normalize SQLite naive datetimes to UTC-aware before expiry checks;
  prevents 500 errors from offset-naive vs offset-aware comparisons.

### Additional live playback fixes

- `apps/governance/src/governance_service/services/governance_service.py`:
  - Resolve proposal/vote `chain_id` to the configured `default_chain_id` so off-chain block-height and voting-power queries target the correct chain database.
  - Calculate off-chain vote weight from staked governance tokens when `enable_onchain_submission` is `false`.
- `cli/aitbc_cli/commands/governance.py`: pass `executor_address` as a URL query string for `aitbc governance execute`.
- `apps/coordinator-api/src/coordinator_api/contexts/infrastructure/services/jobs.py`: normalize naive SQLite datetimes to UTC-aware before comparison.
- `apps/coordinator-api/src/coordinator_api/contexts/infrastructure/services/receipts.py`: derive `started_at` from `completed_at - units` so the receipt duration is internally consistent.
- `cli/aitbc_cli/commands/dashboard.py`, `apps/coordinator-api/src/coordinator_api/contexts/infrastructure/services/jobs.py`, `apps/coordinator-api/src/coordinator_api/schemas/__init__.py`: show `Model` and `Created` columns in the customer dashboard by including `payload`/`result` in `JobView`.

- feat(cli): add `aitbc zk` command group with `health`, `circuits`, and
  `verify` subcommands; supports `--proof-id`, `--job-id`, and `--proof-file`.
- feat(coordinator): add `POST /v1/zk/receipt/verify` to verify the stored
  ZK receipt proof for a completed job.

- `apps/exchange/simple_exchange/handlers/bridge.py` and `handlers/__init__.py`: add `GET /cross-chain/rates` with indicative ETH/AITBC rates and a trusted-custodian status note.
